  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d5ed36415cf0f2440b5ce99be205695c, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_Dev
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game.Runtime::Game.Dialogue.DialogueGraph
  graphId: DLG_DEV
  entryNodeIds:
  - DEV_AFTER_SLEEP
  - DEV_QUEST
  - DEV_INTRO
  nodes:
  - DialogueId: DEV_INTRO
    Speaker: Dev
    Text: There he is. Thirty laps of the training ground before sunrise and he still walks like he is being marked on it.
    RequiredFlags: []
    BlockingFlags:
    - QUEENS_CHARGE_GIVEN
    RequiredMemoryId: 
    RequiredMemoryState: 
    Consequences:
    - Type: 0
      Target: SPOKE_TO_DEV
      Amount: 0
    Choices:
    - Text: You counted my laps?
      NextDialogueId: DEV_JOKE
      RequiredFlags: []
      BlockingFlags: []
      Consequences: []
    - Text: The Queen sent for me.
      NextDialogueId: DEV_SERIOUS
      RequiredFlags: []
      BlockingFlags: []
      Consequences: []
    NextDialogueId: 
    Subtitle: 
    VoiceAssetId: 
  - DialogueId: DEV_JOKE
    Speaker: Dev
    Text: I count everything. It is the only thing I am better at than you, and I intend to keep it.
    RequiredFlags: []
    BlockingFlags: []
    RequiredMemoryId: 
    RequiredMemoryState: 
    Consequences: []
    Choices: []
    NextDialogueId: DEV_SERIOUS
    Subtitle: 
    VoiceAssetId: 
  - DialogueId: DEV_SERIOUS
    Speaker: Dev
    Text: She sends for you a great deal lately. Go on. I will be here - the market does not guard itself, and someone has to be seen failing to guard it.
    RequiredFlags: []
    BlockingFlags: []
    RequiredMemoryId: 
    RequiredMemoryState: 
    Consequences:
    - Type: 5
      Target: DEV
      Amount: 1
    Choices: []
    NextDialogueId: 
    Subtitle: 
    VoiceAssetId: 
  - DialogueId: DEV_QUEST
    Speaker: Dev
    Text: The old ruins? Ishan, nobody goes out there. Not because it is forbidden. Because nobody thinks of it. I have lived here my whole life and I have never once thought of it. Does that not strike you as strange?
    RequiredFlags:
    - QUEENS_CHARGE_GIVEN
    BlockingFlags:
    - RETURNED_TO_AMARA
    RequiredMemoryId: 
    RequiredMemoryState: 
    Consequences: []
    Choices: []
    NextDialogueId: 
    Subtitle: 
    VoiceAssetId: 
  - DialogueId: DEV_AFTER_SLEEP
    Speaker: Dev
    Text: ...
